  "long_description": "Light Anchor is building the AI-native P&G.\r\n\r\nConsumer brands have always grown at the speed of the people running them. Every new product, market, or channel meant more hires.\r\n\r\nAI agents can now handle marketing, operations, product development, and manufacturing from start to finish. That makes a new kind of business possible: one limited by compute, not headcount.\r\n\r\nToday, Light Anchor operates 10 brands, all run by AI agents on a shared platform that compounds with every new brand launched. Our goal is to run thousands of consumer brands, operating with little to no human intervention.",
